⟦KEN 1⟧ Church on Air · a 1990s local-TV invitation
⍝ KEN: Kenotic Editing Notes. Intent first; cuts, surfaces and restraint follow.
⍝ A faithful transcription of the delivered 72.48-second church film.
⍝ This is an intent export, not a claim that a KEN parser has executed it.
⍝ The delivered film was lowered through Encounter/REL, Temple and native media tools.
⍝ Paths below are relative to applications/church-on-air unless explicitly bound.

§ intent
  purpose "Give the invitation the exuberance of late-night 1990s television; then make room for worship."
  form local-TV invitation · sincere · playful graphics
  centre people worshipping together
  footage ≡ the five supplied videos     ⍝ real people, real places; no generated church scenes
  speech ⊆ selected source audio         ⍝ no newly performed or synthesized speech
  music ≡ selected church audio          ⍝ follows its own corresponding pictures
  claims ⊆ visible footage + attributed source wording
  invitation ⚑ editorial copy            ⍝ an invitation, not evidence of an achieved outcome
  contact @TanksAaron
  end "COME AS YOU ARE"
  restraint ⊢ the graphics yield to the worship, then return for the closing invitation

§ voice ∅
§ sfx ∅                                  ⍝ picture tracking adds no artificial audio static
§ music source-only                      ⍝ no replacement soundtrack or synthetic music

§ bind
  media config(".local/config.json").mediaDir
  evidence ".local/analysis.json"
  graphics "source/graphics.json"
  renderer "native/render.py"
  output ".local/church-on-air-b77f1cb50f72c2c4.mp4"

