§ testimony
  AARON "I LOVE MY CHURCH."
    source HOME.origin
    delivery on-screen attribution "- AARON"
    ⍝ The supplied tweet's wording; no invented spoken testimonial.

§ time
  fps 25 · frames 1812 · duration 72.48
  units seconds · ranges [in,out) · frame-grid .04
  shot ≥1 · gap 0 · overlap 0
  transition .48                         ⍝ 12 incoming frames; does not shorten the sequence
  transition-source previous final picture held beneath the incoming picture
  transition-ease p ↦ 1−(1−p)³
  picture-end fade last 12 frames
  ⍝ Tempo/onset measurements informed selection; lyric and bar boundaries were editorial.

§ screen
  source 16:9 → 640×360 · bicubic
  graphics 320×240 → 640×480 · nearest
  compose 640×480 · 4:3 → 960×720 · nearest
  codec H.264 · yuv420p · crf 19 · preset fast · faststart
  audio AAC · stereo · 48000 Hz · 192 kb/s
  fonts title "Arial Bold" · detail "Cascadia Mono"
  title fit width and height             ⍝ reduce size rather than spill into the picture

§ palette
  ink #0b0820 · violet #5127a5 · cyan #52f9db
  yellow #ffef66 · pink #ff6dce · white #ffffff

