  full
    background source-picture · blur radius 10 · brightness ×.25
    picture (0,60,640,360) ⊂ compose
    title (10,216) · width 300 · height 20 · size ≤14 · yellow · extrusion 2
    masthead and title visible first 1.25
    secondary-caption metadata-only      ⍝ it is not painted by this layout
    after 1.25 ⊢ only the real picture and its existing source captions remain

§ transition
  cut instantaneous
  push previous exits left · incoming enters from right
  iris expanding centred circular reveal
  venetian horizontal slats · compose-pitch 32
  spin incoming grows 0→1 · rotation 270°→0° over held previous picture

§ tape                                   ⍝ compose pixels; local frame i starts again at each shot
  seed 1979+i · generator NumPy default_rng
  red shift +1 horizontal · blue shift −1 horizontal
  scanlines every second row ×.90
  grain integer −3…+3 · monochrome · every frame
  heavy tracking active every frame
  burst tracking active i mod 150 <15     ⍝ .60 seconds in every six-second local cycle
  soft tracking sparse lower-edge noise i mod 250 <2
  active-band y=floor((local-seconds×235) mod 480) · height ≤12
  active-shear row-shift trunc(9×sin(row×1.7+local-seconds×14))
  active-static two rows every fifth frame · lower five rows each active frame
  ⍝ Exact raster primitives, rounding and layer order bind to the declared renderer.

§ audio
  gain OVERFLOW ×1.2279 · REVIVAL ×1.3143 · SUNDAY ×.7973 · HOME ×1.5021 · GLORY ×.5499
  process resample 48000 → gain → highpass 55 Hz → lowpass 10500 Hz → limit .9
  limiter auto-makeup false
  continuity ⊢ adjacent ranges of the same source become one unbroken audio group
  source-group edges fade-in .12 · fade-out .12
  joins concatenate                       ⍝ edge fades, not crossfades; no time is removed

§ shot                                   ⍝ film interval · source interval · then named presentation choices
▸ signal                                 ⍝ frames [0,84)
  at [0.00,3.36) · clip OVERFLOW [35.00,38.36)
  surface card · enter cut · tape heavy
  title "CHURCH ON AIR"
  caption "FAITH. WORSHIP. COMMUNITY."
  reason "Acquire the signal. A short receiver lock establishes the era immediately."

▸ overflow                               ⍝ frames [84,335)
  at [3.36,13.40) · clip OVERFLOW [38.36,48.40)
  surface split · enter push · tape burst
  title "GET READY FOR THE OVERFLOW"
  caption "A LOCAL CHURCH. / AN OPEN INVITATION."
  audio continue signal
  reason "Make the invitation large; give the graphics a surface without covering faces."

▸ names                                  ⍝ frames [335,493)
  at [13.40,19.72) · clip REVIVAL [30.36,36.68)
  surface hero · enter venetian · tape burst
  title "PERTH REVIVAL"
  caption "YAHWEH / RAPHA / ELOHIM"
  reason "A fresh refrain and a brisk movement; change the register before the frame opens."

▸ room                                   ⍝ frames [493,651)
  at [19.72,26.04) · clip REVIVAL [36.68,43.00)
  surface full · enter iris · tape soft
  title "MAKE ROOM" · hold 1.25
  metadata-caption "WORSHIP. PRAYER. COMMUNITY."
  audio continue names
  reason "Open the enclosure while the original source and audio remain continuous."

▸ worship                                ⍝ frames [651,985)
  at [26.04,39.40) · clip SUNDAY [50.32,63.68)
  surface full · enter cut · tape soft
  title "THERE IS NO OTHER NAME" · hold 1.25
  metadata-caption "SUNDAY SERVICE / PERTH"
  reason "The symmetry break: a longer, nearly unadorned passage. Let the worship carry the film."

▸ home                                   ⍝ frames [985,1310)
  at [39.40,52.40) · clip HOME [57.08,70.08)
  surface split · enter spin · tape burst
  title "A PLACE TO CALL HOME"
  caption "I LOVE MY CHURCH. / - AARON"
  reason "Return to invitation language, with the author's own statement and a deliberately cheesy arrival."

▸ glory                                  ⍝ frames [1310,1644)
  at [52.40,65.76) · clip GLORY [13.20,26.56)
  surface hero · enter push · tape soft
  title "ALL THE GLORY"
  caption "ALL THE PRAISE. / UNTO YOU JESUS."
  reason "Let the brighter source settle. Secondary words belong in the rolling strip."

▸ invitation                             ⍝ frames [1644,1812)
  at [65.76,72.48) · clip GLORY [26.56,33.28)
  surface card · enter iris · tape burst
  title "COME AS YOU ARE"
  caption "KINGDOMCITY / PERTH / @TanksAaron"
  audio continue glory
  reason "Hold a generous final invitation over the continuing church audio."

