§ yield
  ⊢ intent, words, source ranges, surfaces and restraint are named editable choices
  ⊢ source footage and source audio remain identifiable; their edits do not become new testimony
  ⊢ an edit changes the intended film; the receipt above continues to identify the delivered predecessor
  ⊢ executable predecessor: source/composition.encounter + source/composition.rel
  ⊢ raster vocabulary: source/graphics.json + native/render.py
  ⊢ KEN-to-Encounter lowering remains to be implemented and checked; this export does not claim it
